        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADCAVE — About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the dark caves, survival is everything.<br><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> is a fast–paced 2D pixel-art endless shooter where quick reflexes, weapon mastery, and precise sword strikes decide how long you can endure. Waves of enemies grow tougher with every step, forcing you to deflect bullets, grab fallen weapons before they vanish, and unleash devastating ultimate attacks at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.apng?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=79 height=79 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.webp?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=120 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.apng?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Combat</strong> – Cut down enemies and reflect incoming bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong> – Pick up unique weapons dropped by enemies, each lasting for a limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Bullet Types</strong> – Standard shots, piercing bullets, and ricocheting projectiles for dynamic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Ability</strong> – Evade danger, reposition quickly, or close the gap for a strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Attack</strong> – Wipe out every enemy on screen in one powerful blast.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Waves</strong> – Face melee and ranged foes with different attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong> – Tweak the challenge to your skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> – Compete globally based on kills and difficulty settings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> delivers a raw, skill–based action experience with a dark atmosphere, tight controls, and satisfying combat feedback.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADCAVE — About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the dark caves, survival is everything.<br><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> is a fast–paced 2D pixel-art endless shooter where quick reflexes, weapon mastery, and precise sword strikes decide how long you can endure. Waves of enemies grow tougher with every step, forcing you to deflect bullets, grab fallen weapons before they vanish, and unleash devastating ultimate attacks at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.apng?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=79 height=79 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.webp?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=120 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.apng?t=1781998158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.poster.avif?t=1781998158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Combat</strong> – Cut down enemies and reflect incoming bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong> – Pick up unique weapons dropped by enemies, each lasting for a limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Bullet Types</strong> – Standard shots, piercing bullets, and ricocheting projectiles for dynamic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Ability</strong> – Evade danger, reposition quickly, or close the gap for a strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Attack</strong> – Wipe out every enemy on screen in one powerful blast.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Waves</strong> – Face melee and ranged foes with different attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong> – Tweak the challenge to your skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> – Compete globally based on kills and difficulty settings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> delivers a raw, skill–based action experience with a dark atmosphere, tight controls, and satisfying combat feedback.</p>",
